Task: Extract the following fields as JSON: company_name, job_title, location, language, salary, point_of_contact. Stick to one language unless it's really mixed. Use null for unknown values. For point_of_contact, extract if present: name, role (their role in the company), contact_details (email, phone, etc.), and notes. If no point of contact is found, set point_of_contact to null.

Respond with JSON only. Example format:
{"company_name":"Acme","job_title":"Senior Engineer","location":"Remote","language":"English","salary":"€80-100k","point_of_contact":{"name":"John Doe","role":"HR Manager","contact_details":"john.doe@acme.com","notes":"Please contact via email"}}

Original Job Description:
Generali sucht eine:n Data Engineer (m/w/d) in Zürich.
Anforderungen: Python, SQL, AWS, ETL-Pipelines, fliessend Deutsch.
Wir bieten flexible Arbeitszeiten.

